@startuml
title Webhook PayOS xác nhận thanh toán
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #222222
  ActorBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ActorBorderColor #222222
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  BoundaryBorderColor #222222
  ControlBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ControlBorderColor #222222
  EntityBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  EntityBorderColor #222222
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  MessageAlign center
}

entity PayOS
control API
control PaymentService
entity PayOSProvider
entity PostgreSQL
control InvoiceService

PayOS->API: POST /payments/payos/webhook
API->PaymentService: Receive webhook payload
PaymentService->PayOSProvider: Verify signature and payload
PayOSProvider-->PaymentService: Valid webhook
PaymentService->PostgreSQL: Find attempt by order code and link ID
PostgreSQL-->PaymentService: Local attempt
PaymentService->PayOSProvider: Query payment link status
PayOSProvider->PayOS: GET payment link
PayOS-->PayOSProvider: PAID and aggregate amount
PayOSProvider-->PaymentService: Verified full payment
PaymentService->PostgreSQL: Lock order and payment attempt
PaymentService->PostgreSQL: Mark paid and save transaction reference
PaymentService->InvoiceService: Issue invoice in same transaction
InvoiceService->PostgreSQL: INSERT invoice if absent
PaymentService->PostgreSQL: COMMIT transaction
API-->PayOS: 200 accepted
@enduml
